{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15065","headline":"酬刘员外月下见寄 · 章八元","name":"酬刘员外月下见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜凉河汉白，卷箔出南轩。\n过月鸿争远，辞枝叶暗翻。\n独谣闻丽曲，缓步接清言。\n宣室思前席，行看拜主恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章八元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15065.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15065","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}